  "worked_solution": "The parametric equations of a horizontal hyperbola with Cartesian equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nare given by\n\n$$\nx=a\\operatorname{sec}\u2061t,\\,y=b\\operatorname{tan}\u2061t.\n$$\n\nIn our case, $a=\\sqrt{81}=9$ and $b=\\sqrt{16}=4.$ Therefore, the parametric equations are\n\n$$\nx=9\\operatorname{sec}\u2061t\\,,\\,y=4\\operatorname{tan}\u2061t.\n$$",
